00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:45.040
because I don't know
how to deal with that.

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:47.158
I never dealt with that in
my life before, you know?

00:12:47.158 --> 00:12:50.277
I always held everything
inside until I blow up.

00:12:50.277 --> 00:12:53.313
You know, but I'm, I'm learning,
little by little and stuff.

00:12:54.410 --> 00:12:56.280
So I tryin' to stay out of jail.

00:12:56.280 --> 00:12:57.940
I've been out since 2013.

00:12:57.940 --> 00:12:58.920
I'm doing good.

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:01.145
I ain't bothered nobody in a long time.

00:13:01.145 --> 00:13:02.030
You know?

00:13:02.030 --> 00:13:03.398
I don't sell no drugs.

00:13:03.398 --> 00:13:06.760
I don't do nothing stupid man.

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:07.593
- [Interviewer] Do you have any friends?

00:13:07.593 --> 00:13:08.426
- I don't want to go back, huh?

00:13:08.426 --> 00:13:10.090
- [Interviewer] Do you have any friends?

00:13:10.090 --> 00:13:11.430
- Not really, man.

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:13.400
You know, I'm too scared
to let anybody in.

00:13:13.400 --> 00:13:15.360
You know?

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:17.340
They, my therapist telling me I have a lot

00:13:17.340 --> 00:13:19.340
