stuff like that, I mean-

00:13:19.340 --> 00:13:22.130
- [Interviewer] Is there
anyone you trust in your life?

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:24.530
- Yeah, my oldest sister,
Darlene, that's the one

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:27.490
that my father (air brakes
hiss) tried to rape,

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:28.520
(engine idles) my, Darlene and stuff.

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:29.610
That's the only, I call.

00:13:29.610 --> 00:13:32.090
That's the only phone
number I know by heart.

00:13:32.090 --> 00:13:33.100
You know, I'll call home. (engine revs)

00:13:33.100 --> 00:13:36.420
And I talked to her when
I'm feeling down and stuff.

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:37.860
Last time I spoke to her

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:40.446
I couldn't understand why
I was crying and stuff.

00:13:40.446 --> 00:13:43.870
She told me because you feeling stuff now.

00:13:43.870 --> 00:13:45.300
You finally letting you know,

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:47.080
your feelings show now and stuff.

00:13:47.080 --> 00:13:49.620
You never did that before,
(birds chirp) but I'm trying now.

00:13:49.620 --> 00:13:52.610
She wants me to settle down,
get married and all that,

00:13:52.610 --> 00:13:53.723
but I'm too scared.

00:13:54.720 --> 00:13:55.553
I'm too scared.

00:13:55.553 --> 00:13:57.943
I don't want to be like
my father. (birds chirp)

00:13:57.943 --> 00:13:58.776
You know?

00:13:59.640 --> 00:14:00.730
I don't know if, what she says

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:03.340
you got to trust somebody
sometime. (brakes squeal)

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:07.680
But (engine revs) I guess
maybe I will someday.

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:10.080
I just, I don't know when,
(bird chirps) whenever.

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:12.540
I guess whenever, they
