you're ready for it and stuff,

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:18.200
so I'm still waitin', you know?

00:14:18.200 --> 00:14:19.540
I still help people, even,

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:22.090
even though I know they
stealing from me and stuff,

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:23.940
I still help people and stuff.

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:26.170
I ain't never done that
before in my life, man.

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:28.640
I will get you if you
