with it and stuff, you know?

00:14:37.511 --> 00:14:38.344
(birds chirp) - [Interviewer] Yep.

00:14:38.344 --> 00:14:40.030
What's the most important
lesson you've learned,

00:14:40.030 --> 00:14:40.863
