00:14:44.833 --> 00:14:45.840
- Express your feelings.

00:14:45.840 --> 00:14:46.673
Talk about it.

00:14:46.673 --> 00:14:48.080
Learn how to talk about it, man.

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:49.830
'Cause if you don't, it will hurt you.

00:14:49.830 --> 00:14:52.280
You'll always live life
with anger in your heart.

00:14:53.390 --> 00:14:55.010
And I don't want to live like that, man.

00:14:55.010 --> 00:14:57.270
The only capable of time
