the blood coming out, you know?

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:18.453
But right now I really don't
know what to do with my life.

00:15:19.380 --> 00:15:20.213
You know?

00:15:20.213 --> 00:15:22.400
All I learned that I don't
want to go back to prison.

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:25.170
I don't want to hit no woman, you know?

00:15:25.170 --> 00:15:26.507
