somebody. (traffic passes)

00:15:32.544 --> 00:15:33.377
You know?

00:15:35.640 --> 00:15:36.883
- [Robert] So it's just, I live

00:15:36.883 --> 00:15:40.154
I try to live my life
one day at a time, man.

00:15:40.154 --> 00:15:42.330
Try not to break no laws.

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:44.730
Try not to do nothing wrong,

00:15:44.730 --> 00:15:46.107
